{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":4113001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113001,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":411300103,"next_line_ids":[411300106],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":566142922,"text":"还是轻策庄的事。因为掉下来的那些陨石，轻策庄周围的魔物都乱了。它们在路上到处肆虐，轻策庄几乎都要被它们给围住了。","raw_text":"还是轻策庄的事。因为掉下来的那些陨石，轻策庄周围的魔物都乱了。它们在路上到处肆虐，轻策庄几乎都要被它们给围住了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":4113001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113001,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":411300106,"next_line_ids":[411300107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":2963559130,"text":"虽然轻策庄有我们守着，不会出大问题，但是城里支援过来的物资，还是要从外面过来。","raw_text":"虽然轻策庄有我们守着，不会出大问题，但是城里支援过来的物资，还是要从外面过来。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":4113001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113001,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":411300107,"next_line_ids":[411300108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":845542098,"text":"现在这个情况，总务司也不可能分出很多人来护送…要是遇见了大群的魔物，只怕物资会有风险。","raw_text":"现在这个情况，总务司也不可能分出很多人来护送…要是遇见了大群的魔物，只怕物资会有风险。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":4113001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113001,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":411300108,"next_line_ids":[411300109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":836975250,"text":"所以，我和几个兄弟就寻思着…就算不能离开轻策庄太远，但是，轻策庄周围的那些魔物，我们还是能清理一下的。","raw_text":"所以，我和几个兄弟就寻思着…就算不能离开轻策庄太远，但是，轻策庄周围的那些魔物，我们还是能清理一下的。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":4113001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113001,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":411300109,"next_line_ids":[411300110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":1854374626,"text":"这样也算是给送物资过来的兄弟帮个忙了。但按照之前我们的侦察，周围的魔物聚集点还不少。","raw_text":"这样也算是给送物资过来的兄弟帮个忙了。但按照之前我们的侦察，周围的魔物聚集点还不少。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":4113001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113001,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":411300110,"next_line_ids":[411300111],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":3303553602,"text":"只凭我们的话，很难把这些魔物营地迅速地全部清理干净。但如果时间拖太长了，我担心轻策庄里说不定也会出问题…","raw_text":"只凭我们的话，很难把这些魔物营地迅速地全部清理干净。但如果时间拖太长了，我担心轻策庄里说不定也会出问题…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":4113001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113001,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":411300111,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":3713184586,"text":"旅行者，你愿意帮我们去清理一部分魔物吗？","raw_text":"旅行者，你愿意帮我们去清理一部分魔物吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":4113002,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113002,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":411300201,"next_line_ids":[411300202],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":3662213890,"text":"不行…必须得要人来支援…","raw_text":"不行…必须得要人来支援…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113002.json"}
