{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":4113002,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113002,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":411300204,"next_line_ids":[411300205],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":1248925458,"text":"我本来以为，在轻策庄外围徘徊的只有一些普通的魔物…","raw_text":"我本来以为，在轻策庄外围徘徊的只有一些普通的魔物…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113002.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":4113002,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113002,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":411300205,"next_line_ids":[411300206],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":2716430042,"text":"我领着几个人，刚清理完了一个魔物营地，正准备休息一下之后再继续前进。","raw_text":"我领着几个人，刚清理完了一个魔物营地，正准备休息一下之后再继续前进。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113002.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-41130","main_id":41130,"main_title":"轻策之围","main_description":"千岩军经纶正在为如何清理周围的魔物而烦恼…","chapter_title":"轻策之围","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":4113002,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":4113002,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":411300206,"next_line_ids":[411300207],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30014,"speaker_text_hash":352272869,"speaker":"经纶","speaker_raw":"经纶","text_hash":652858290,"text":"但是旁边的树林里，突然出现了一只丘丘岩盔王…","raw_text":"但是旁边的树林里，突然出现了一只丘丘岩盔王…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/4113002.json"}
